3. **Kill table: named catches check out; outside-table mutants still survive.**

   **MEASURED, read-only text audit:** I checked **105/105** saved table entries. Every named catch appears among its recorded failures; there are **zero omitted named catches**. All 105 mutation search strings occur exactly once in the current launcher.

