strument of each enumerated label-swap variant, including the relevant state-conditioned variants.  Existing rows may discharge them; predictions or aggregate detection do not substitute for the individual measurements.  Table 11's K2 PER-ROW prediction error is the recorded caution.  The added label enumeration is bounded to the ONE skipped dispatch in the enclosing function; it does not recurse into further dispatches or dispatches in callees.  MINTED FROM ONE DEVICE: on first reuse, check that the skipped-label enumeration and its bounded predicate/state product fit the new device.**  And the measuring seat's own bound -- the cross-product
