C:/DocumentNoSnc/cc/GXEMUL/GXEMUL-SEC\regress\artifacts\agypack_20261013\adj_563_ruling\grok_adj_563_ruling.txt:63:- DEPENDS ON, `:1362-1365`: exactly two things — predicates dominating the diff's edited lines, up to the enclosing function only, and operand-swaps drawn only from fields the guarded body reads. `:1431-1436`: the floor owed a row is the cross-product of those dominating predicates with the device-state lvalues the repair path reads; other joint cells are clause-(e) debt.
