   **REASONED grading: all nine are clause-(e) debt.** A–G alter output/content values or artifact lifecycle beyond the bounded repair-predicate enumeration. H/I restrict lexical members consumed by `sed`; the launcher has no conditional partition distinguishing those individual digits or letters. Treating the callee’s internal matching implementation as additional shell floor predicates would exceed the enclosing-function bound. This also matches the v5 treatment of the parameterless-CSI escape. Their consequences remain real; the broader synthetic-input CONTRACT owes coverage or an explicit limitation.

